(property "Note" "4-20mA shunt 0.1%. Batch 29 (pass-3 m4): 1206 0.25 W AR06BTCV1000 -> 2010 0.5 W RT2010BKD07100RL (same 0.1 %/25 ppm, ~2.5x thermal mass) + firmware over-range trip (docs/FW_REQ_BATCH29.md FW-AI-2: >25 mA -> shunt off within 50 ms, latch). A series PTC was rejected: AI1..AI6 are measured at the terminal node, so a PTC in the shunt leg adds its drifting resistance to every 4-20 mA reading, and one in the input line adds it to every resistive-sender reading." (at 638.81 82.55 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
