(text "INPUTS. AI: 1mA PNP current source (LM4040 2.5V ref from VBAT_P, LM2904, 2.49k), BSS84 disable; 4-20mA via 100R + DMN6075S shunt switch;\n100k/18k divider to VMID(1.65V) -> ADS1115 x2 (0x48/0x49). DI: 68k/33k + 100nF -> 74HC14; bank bias via SI2309 (pull-up) / DMN6075S (pull-down).\nMPU: 10k series, 1M bias to VMID, TLV1812 (RRI, push-pull; Batch 27) w/ hysteresis -> TIM2_CH1. D+: 50R 2512 pre-drop + LM317 125mA source (10R) + SS110, sense 100k/10k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53e3c52b-ac83-45fa-8608-9f7475a6c082"))
