(text "Batch 31 hardware shunt-off gating (Ethan approved Nov 22, 2026 HST). Each 4-20\nmA shunt FET gate AI_SH_Gx = AI_SH_ENx (U31 TCA9555) AND SH_ALLOW. SH_ALLOW =\nWD_OK (U84, latched low on TPS3431 timeout until power cycle) AND NRST (MCU\nreset, through U93 Schmitt buffer as NRST_S). Shunts are therefore off while the\nMCU is in reset, after a watchdog trip, and for the first 0.70-1.06 s after\npower-on. R138/R149/R160/R171/R182/R193 keep the U31-side enables low while U31\npins are inputs; RN1/RN2 hold the FET gates low if U91/U92 are unpowered.\nFirmware: treat AI 4-20 mA channels as invalid while SH_ALLOW (WD_OK) is low.\nSee docs/FW_REQ_BATCH30.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 822.96 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "707edf7f-c1cf-4046-911e-54b783b4d0f1"))
)
